{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Pack includes:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sherman VC Firefly (Rank 3 Great Britain); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A30 &quot;Avenger&quot; (Rank 3 Great Britain);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crusader III AA Mk II (Rank 3 Great Britain);   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premium Account for 15 days;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1000 Golden Eagles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sherman VC Firefly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A classic British modification of the American Sherman, equipped with a long-barreled 17-pounder gun\u2014one of the most powerful Allied anti-tank weapons of the war. This Firefly variant features mounted track links, including captured German ones affixed to the front hull. The vehicle is also fitted with a two-tone camouflage net draped over the hull and turret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Avenger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tank destroyer developed on the basis of the A30 Challenger medium tank and armed with the 76 mm Ordnance QF 17-pounder gun. This version features a lightweight camouflage net and an array of external gear inspired by wartime photographs of British vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crusader AA Mk II</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mobile anti-aircraft vehicle with an enclosed turret that provides protection against air attacks. Built on the Crusader tank chassis, it is armed with twin 20 mm Oerlikon automatic cannons. The camouflage and external fittings are modeled after vehicles used during the Normandy landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refund is not provided if you purchase 2 different packs which include the same vehicle or you already have the vehicle from this pack! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available for Linux, Windows and Mac only. You can't activate this item for the PSN or Xbox Live account.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752050?t=1750842853","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752050?t=1750842853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752050/677ef1dc7b8b8a42cc064477b508b09f541fc363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750842853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752050/677ef1dc7b8b8a42cc064477b508b09f541fc363/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750842853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Pack includes:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sherman VC Firefly (Rank 3 Great Britain); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A30 &quot;Avenger&quot; (Rank 3 Great Britain);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crusader III AA Mk II (Rank 3 Great Britain);   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premium Account for 15 days;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1000 Golden Eagles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sherman VC Firefly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A classic British modification of the American Sherman, equipped with a long-barreled 17-pounder gun\u2014one of the most powerful Allied anti-tank weapons of the war. This Firefly variant features mounted track links, including captured German ones affixed to the front hull. The vehicle is also fitted with a two-tone camouflage net draped over the hull and turret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Avenger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tank destroyer developed on the basis of the A30 Challenger medium tank and armed with the 76 mm Ordnance QF 17-pounder gun. This version features a lightweight camouflage net and an array of external gear inspired by wartime photographs of British vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crusader AA Mk II</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mobile anti-aircraft vehicle with an enclosed turret that provides protection against air attacks. Built on the Crusader tank chassis, it is armed with twin 20 mm Oerlikon automatic cannons. The camouflage and external fittings are modeled after vehicles used during the Normandy landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refund is not provided if you purchase 2 different packs which include the same vehicle or you already have the vehicle from this pack! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available for Linux, Windows and Mac only. You can't activate this item for the PSN or Xbox Live account.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gaijin Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"236390","name":"War Thunder"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"h